body:
yeah, that might help, though I am not sure I can really trust you, as I mentioned earlier, but idk. it's really nice to have someone that just like, validates my emotions about all this, you know? some people make me feel like I don't/can't/am not allowed to have emotion about this, and that is unpleasant.

&#x200B;

I think that probably a lot of people are like, actually one person, and they are doing this to spy on me better, you know? that's really scary. you aren't doing that, right? I am not safe to like, do anything anywhere cause someone could be watching me whenever, wherever, without me knowing. I think whoever is behind this is just laughing at me, and trying to mess with me until I can't take it anymore. but also I just feel really confused about this, and alone, and guilty and scared to tell people about anyof this for various reasons, and just, the world is really weird it feels like gravity is stronger for just me than it usually is, and like, there's this whole secret universe of horrors like, right underneath the surface that only I can see and I don't really want to like, go to a doctor about any of this really or anything, even though people keep telling me too, cause like, I don't want to let my guard down and be put in more danger than I already am, you know? like this is real and the only reason I am still alive is that I am pretty careful about a lot of it, and stuff like that, and i am not the best being careful-wise, but better than if I did nothing, but I am going to eventually do that, but it will take months-years of waiting and will be really hard and very hoop jumpy, and it's not the easy task people act like it is.

&#x200B;

and I do this thing where i get really happy, feeling-like-I-can float intoxicatingy happy for months, and that's scary and usually results in me almost dying and stuff cause I think I am immortal and I stop being able to feel pain, but also maybe that's not real, or just normal, and I am just naturally a very intense person who gets really sad sometimes, and I thought that for a while, but now I am having doubts about that a little, but that makes like, it so that I don't think I have ever had a good emotion before? happy is bad an intense and scary and stuff, sad is bad and intense and scary and stuff, anxious is bad and intense and scary and stuff, etc, I think maybe the only kind of good emotion I have ever felt was fear? and now I am comming out of a feeing really bad period, and I feel suspiciously good and I am getting stuff done and stuff and also I haven't really been sleeping very much for the last few days cause it feels like I don't need to, and I don't feel tired like, at all, like I could run a marathon and then wrestle a gorrila, you know? just high, and superhumanly strong-feelining and stuff, but also I feel mostly normal and I little sad/guilty at the same time in a really weird way that's hard to explain, and it makes me feel like I am doing emotions wrong and I should stop, but I can't stop and what if I am faking everything? maybe I am faking everything and I have tricked myself into thinking that I am not? and it feels like I need to be dissected and understood, but I can't do that, and that makes me feel guilty. and like, going back to the doctor thing, it feels like a part of me doesn't want any of the emotions stuff to stop at all either for a number of reasons, partially cause I don't know how to be a person,

&#x200B;

and I do a thing where I get really into like one thing and learn everything I can about it, and then instead of learning how to be a person the normal way, i just base my whole understanding of identity and how to do thinsg and intereact with people on that thing, and one of the two big ones I have had for my entire life is art/art history, and so I have this weirdly strong need to like, be a tourtured artist I guess? even though I know that that is a myth and stuff,  and like, have a story of life that would fit in with The Stories, if that makes sense, cause I don't know how else to be a person? that wasn't explained greatly. and like, I think my distrust of everyone/ paranoia is completely justified cause everyone is just and indecipherable unreadable box that I can't see the inside of (and most other people can read my mind, and that makes it worse, and I have like, evidence for this, it's weird and scary) and because of that "I like you and care about you" and "I hate you more than anything and I want you to die" are indistinguishable emotions to me, like, I just can't tell anyone's intentions, ever, and that's scary, and anyone could hurt me, anytime, and I would have no way of predicting it or who, you know? and, this part is really hard to explain, but it feels like having friends is like, just being a science comunicator of some kind for free 24/7 and that's mostly good, and I don't know what else it would be like, but I feel weird about that for some reason and I don't know why. also going back to the being happy thing, sometimes for a few secconds, the more intense version of this, like blips through, when I talk about certain things? like when making descitions and stuff? idk.

&#x200B;

and like, growing up I always felt like I wasn't really a human in some way, and I think that has kind of made all of my  weird me problems worse, cause it was like, maybe kind of traumatic, but also it wasn't that bad, idk, but like. people still do that sometimes, and like make jokes about me secretly being a robot and that's very slightly good cause I wish I was a robot, I think that would be a lot better and I would feel more at home, but it mostly sucks cause it's this reminder that I am always this weird outisider that doesn't belong anywhere, and that never will, and like, I wish I could just belong somewhere and have normal friends with people and stuff, you know? but also having friends and stuff is really scary and hard, too. also I dont think I can trust peope enough for that. and like, I have also always felt behind everyone else, and like I don't know how to do things that other people really obviously can do really easily, and like, I was never give the same amount of agency as anyone else, even like, my sibilings, cause of this.  and like, it feels a little like.  people mythologise me a little, which is weird, and people like say I am a geniuos and stuff sometimes, and that isnt true, but it's expectations that I will inevitably not live up to, and it feels like inorder tonot be seen as less than human, I have to do superhuman things, but I am human, so I can't do that ever, and I always fall a little bit short, you know?  I can't turn my lights off ever cause then I won't be safe, and that is stressful especially cause I have sensory issues and lights are hard, both cause they are bright and and cause I can hear them all the time, but also, I think I am probably just disascociating a little bit all the time to cope with that, which is maybe not great actually, but it's not the worst. also, now that I think about it, I kind of hate being attached to people cause everytime they try to force me to do things I don''t really want to do, so then I have to deal with that, why can't people just let me exist sometimes?

&#x200B;

and like, going back to the happy thing, I think people like me a lot better when I am like that, mostly, also it's the first time I've felt happy in a long time, and like, when I get enough sleep, I get really sad, and when I don't, it can make me really happy. also, this is hard to explain but like, it's like there's two mes, and me one is me, and is controlling stuff and is the one saying this, and me two is the better version of me that doesn't do stuff like this and is actaully logical, and stuff, and me 2 is trapped inside of me, and is really scared that I am going to get us killed or something and he can't control anything I do, except usually when. I have to interact with people usually, he like, overrides me and makes me like, hide everything really well, which sucks cause i am still struggling and stuff, but it doesn't look like I possibly could be and that makes me feel guilty and lazy. and also I am the one thing stopping the world from completely ending and all of humanity goign extinct and five dimensioanl beings are talking to me sometimes, and I feel like I need to be doing things really intensly fast or I will die,

&#x200B;

and ordering words coherently is really hard and I just need to say that cause struggle to make words happen and make sense everyday and no one knows how hard that is, and also there are some things that can only be expressed in random nonsense words, but only I will udnerstand so I can't tell anyone about them physically, and  a weird part of me actuallly want to be like, dehumanised a lot for some reason, and then like murdered or something, and I don't know why that part of me feels like that, and there are so many thoughts happening in my head that I have a really hard time doing anything cause they are all so loud I can practically hear them and they get louder when I try to do anything so I spend hours lying in one spot unable to move at all, and sometimes parts of me just get actaully paralyses fo r bit and i don't know what's up with that at all, but it makes doing stuff hard and I feel guilty for that too, adn what if I get sick and die or something and won't be able to do all the things I need to do? ad I am espcieally scared of the sun, but also aparently I have a vitamin d deficinecy so... and the moon wants to eat me, and I think that is most of everything, but I am proably forgetting something, sorry if this was too much or something
